Package: uzunyx-doctor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, konsole, kdialog, sudo, util-linux, make
Recommends: timeshift, git
Description: updates the system and checks that Uzunyx still works
 A guided routine: checks, snapshot, simulated upgrade, upgrade, rebuild of
 the KWin effects tied to the KWin version, and a last round of checks after
 the next login. It stops and explains when an upgrade wants to remove a
 package of Uzunyx or of the desktop, and reminds once a month to run it.
